# 基本図形編集のプロセスの道具パネル: a subordinate window of the figure's (design 10.4, 11.3), the
# process's own (ui_sub), as ui_fig_panel.steps has it with the desktop's figure editor;
# for tools/ui_run.py. The figure (画用紙, 100,100 to 900,700) is opened: its 道具パネル
# stands whole at the top of the screen (100,0), there being no room under or over it, and
# the two are the nearest windows, the panel in front.
# システム環境設定 opened (160,80 to 772,584) comes in front: the panel is out of sight;
# it is pressed later on its band (700,90), the part of it the figure does not cover.
# The figure pressed where nothing covers it (850,650): it comes forward with the panel
# in front of it again. The initial window BTRON (0,0 to 350,226) pressed: the panel goes
# again, and comes back with the figure. Pressing システム環境設定 puts it away; the
# settings closed, the figure is in front again, and so is its panel.
logmark
pfig 019a0f91-066f-706f-93da-ffe8150d6207
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙
wait 2000
front f1 道具パネル|画用紙
expect ok f1: in front
shot fp_open
# another program's window in front: the panel is hidden
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
hidden h1 道具パネル
expect ok h1: hidden
front h1f システム環境設定|画用紙
expect ok h1f: in front
shot fp_other
# the figure brought back in front: the panel comes with it, in front of it
click 850 650
wait 300
front f2 道具パネル|画用紙
expect ok f2: in front
shot fp_back
# another program's window pressed: hidden again
click 700 90
wait 300
hidden h2 道具パネル
expect ok h2: hidden
front h2f システム環境設定|画用紙
expect ok h2f: in front
# the desktop's own window (the initial window) pressed: hidden too
click 50 200
wait 300
hidden h3 道具パネル
expect ok h3: hidden
front h3f BTRON
expect ok h3f: in front
click 850 650
wait 300
front f3 道具パネル|画用紙
expect ok f3: in front
# the settings pressed and closed: the figure is the nearest again, with its panel
click 700 90
wait 300
hidden h4 道具パネル
expect ok h4: hidden
key 08 01
expect sysenv: closed
wait 500
front f4 道具パネル|画用紙
expect ok f4: in front
shot fp_closed
absent !OACV!
# the figure closed: its panel goes with it
key 08 01
expect figure: tool panel closed
expect figure: closed
